{"availability":"available","full":"shughes-mp/AI_demo","name":"AI_demo","description":"Source-first AI tutoring for reading-based courses: Socratic learner dialogue, traceable formative evidence, instructor review, teaching briefs, and instructor-controlled Observer/Guide/Conductor facilitation.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-09T14:09:26Z","updated":"2026-09-25T05:24:57Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-demo-learning.vercel.app/demo","topics":["ai-tutor","anthropic","education","evidence-based-teaching","formative-assessment","learning-analytics","nextjs","socratic-learning"],"demo":"https://ai-demo-learning.vercel.app/demo","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:07.126Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:07.126Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:07.126Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:08:07.126Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AIdemo helps instructors turn reading-based learner dialogue into usable formative evidence and practical teaching next steps.","It is built for courses where interpretation, reasoning, and application matter. Instructors upload course readings, define learning goals, preview what learners will experience, share a link, and then review source-linked evidence, learner activity, and teaching briefs after students work with the tutor.","The current application covers the roadmap through Phase 8.5: instructor setup, learner dialogue, evidence provenance and review, source-use checks, assessment protection, learner reflection, exportable teaching briefs, instructor-controlled teaching moves, pre-session planning with a faithful learner preview, and a calmer instructor workflow built around four required setup cards, one merged preview-and-share launch step, and collapsed optional planning and safeguard sections."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shughes-mp/AI_demo/bl